---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const updated = 'July 2026';
---
<Base
  title="Responsible Gambling — Bet Safely & Get Help"
  description="Gambling should stay fun. Learn the warning signs of problem gambling, tools to stay in control, and free confidential helplines."
  active="">

  <div class="container">
    <div class="page-head">
      <div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Responsible Gambling</div>
      <h1>Responsible <em>gambling</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Betting should be an enjoyable pastime, never a way to make money or chase losses. This page explains how to stay in control and where to get free, confidential help.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="prose">
      <div class="rg-age"><b>18+</b> You must be at least 18 (or the legal age where you live) to gamble.</div>

      <div class="note">If you or someone you know needs help right now, call the National Gambling Helpline free on <strong>0808 8020 133</strong> (UK, 24/7) or visit <a href="https://www.begambleaware.org" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">BeGambleAware.org</a>.</div>

      <h2>Keep it fun — a few simple rules</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Set a budget</strong> and only ever bet money you can comfortably afford to lose.</li>
        <li><strong>Set time and deposit limits</strong> — most licensed operators let you cap deposits, losses and session time in your account settings.</li>
        <li><strong>Never chase losses.</strong> Trying to win back money is the fastest way to lose more.</li>
        <li><strong>Don't bet while upset, bored or under the influence.</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Take regular breaks</strong> and keep gambling as one hobby among others.</li>
        <li>Treat any winnings as a bonus, not income you rely on.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Warning signs of problem gambling</h2>
      <p>Gambling may be becoming a problem if you:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Spend more time or money than you intended, or bet more to feel the same excitement.</li>
        <li>Chase losses or borrow money, sell things, or fall behind on bills to gamble.</li>
        <li>Feel anxious, guilty or irritable about your gambling, or hide it from others.</li>
        <li>Neglect work, studies, family or friends because of betting.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>If any of these feel familiar, you don't have to deal with it alone — the services below are free and confidential.</p>

      <h2>Tools to take a break</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Deposit &amp; loss limits</strong> — available in your account with any licensed operator.</li>
        <li><strong>Time-out / cool-off</strong> — lock your account for 24 hours up to 6 weeks.</li>
        <li><strong>Self-exclusion</strong> — block yourself for 6 months or longer. In the UK, <a href="https://www.gamstop.co.uk" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">GAMSTOP</a> excludes you from all licensed operators at once.</li>
        <li><strong>Blocking software</strong> — <a href="https://gamban.com" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Gamban</a> and similar tools block gambling sites and apps on your devices.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Free, confidential help</h2>
      <div class="rg-help">
        <div class="rg-card">
          <h3>National Gambling Helpline</h3>
          <span class="tel">0808 8020 133</span>
          <p>Free, confidential support 24/7, run by GamCare (UK).</p>
          <a class="btn-line" href="https://www.gamcare.org.uk" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">gamcare.org.uk →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="rg-card">
          <h3>BeGambleAware</h3>
          <p>Advice, self-assessment tools and a free live chat with trained advisers.</p>
          <a class="btn-line" href="https://www.begambleaware.org" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">begambleaware.org →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="rg-card">
          <h3>Gambling Therapy</h3>
          <p>Free online support and resources for players worldwide, in multiple languages.</p>
          <a class="btn-line" href="https://www.gamblingtherapy.org" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">gamblingtherapy.org →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="rg-card">
          <h3>Gamblers Anonymous</h3>
          <p>Local peer-support meetings and a fellowship of people in recovery.</p>
          <a class="btn-line" href="https://www.gamblersanonymous.org.uk" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">gamblersanonymous.org.uk →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>Protecting under-18s</h2>
      <p>Gambling by anyone under 18 is illegal. If children use your devices, consider parental-control and blocking tools such as Gamban, and keep account details private.</p>

      <hr />
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
